# ink_panel board feature options (sourced beside CMakeLists.txt).

config INK_PANEL_EPD
	bool "Enable e-ink panel (bitbang + smoke bringup)"
	default y
	help
	  When disabled, epd_board / cbb/epd are not built and app skips
	  EPD smoke/refresh. Use prj.conf CONFIG_INK_PANEL_EPD=n to gate off.

config INK_PANEL_NFC
	bool "Enable on-chip NFCT Type 2 Tag smoke"
	default y
	help
	  When enabled, builds nfc_board and starts T2T emulation with a fixed
	  NDEF Text payload for EVT field/read smoke. Use prj.conf
	  CONFIG_INK_PANEL_NFC=n to gate off.

menu "Zephyr Kernel"
source "Kconfig.zephyr"
endmenu
